    uuf_rfrl_common.Post Test Verification  ${test_phase}  uuf_rfrl_common.Check BTS State When Bts Is Blocked
    ...  execute_attach=False  reset_check=${False}  alarms_timeout=300   gather_first_passed_snapshot=${False}
